### Get all menu items
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu

### Get menu item by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu/1

### Delete menu item
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu/6

### Add menu item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "del me",
  "price": 4.90,
  "description": "Soft matcha mochi with a sweet matcha filling",
  "dietary": "Gluten-free, Vegan",
  "type": "Mochi"
}

### Update menu item
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/menu/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Brown Sugar Milk Tea",
  "price": 6.30,
  "description": "Black tea with milk, tapioca pearls, and brown sugar flavoring",
  "dietary": "Contains dairy",
  "type": "Milk Tea"
}